{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DkDNMn2Sj7nw3a2Xpswivm","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/bus.mjs://   1. The bus must NEVER slow down or break the pipeline it observes.\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/bus.mjs: * Never throws: a ledger that kills the pipeline it observes is not a ledger.\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:test('observe mode: failed check flows onward but is ON RECORD', async () => {\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:  const s = session({ maxCalls: 5, mode: 'observe' });\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:  assert.equal(s.stats().observedFails, 1);\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:test('observe mode: an un-gated surface flows but is ON RECORD (counted + warned)', async () => {\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:  const s = session({ maxCalls: 5, mode: 'observe', emit: (ev, f) => events.push({ ev, ...f }) });\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:  assert.equal(out.output_text, 'day-one traffic', 'observe mode must not break existing traffic');\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.test.mjs:  assert.equal(s.stats().observedFails, 1);\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs://   - Langfuse `observeOpenAI(client)` / Braintrust `wrapOpenAI(client)`:\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:// 'observe' mode they flow — but loudly, ON RECORD, like every other failure.\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs: * @param {'block'|'observe'} [opts.mode] 'block' (default): a failed call throws\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs: *   RabadonStop so nothing broken flows onward. 'observe': log + count only —\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:  const state = { calls: 0, tokens: 0, blocked: 0, repaired: 0, observedFails: 0 };\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:      state.observedFails += 1; // observe mode: it flows, but it is ON RECORD\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:   * Refuse (block mode) or record-and-pass (observe mode) a spend surface the\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:      // observe: it flows, but LOUDLY — counted as a call, on the record\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:      state.observedFails += 1;\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/core/wrap.mjs:      try { console.warn(`rabadon (observe): ${reason}`); } catch { /* a broken console must not break the call */ }\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/stats.cpp:    out += \"\\\"totals\\\":{\\\"refused\\\":\" + std::to_string(tBlocked) + \",\\\"wouldRefuse\\\":\" + std::to_string(tWould)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0192cvfjsyyZKrJXRYLswB6P","session_id":"81910dae-7509-4342-9a27-c75d4f682cbf","uuid":"ea1c37c8-7002-45e9-a34b-d53941e1b0a7","timestamp":"2026-08-24T13:50:51.196Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Trace counter in observe mode"}
