{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W61mEXUQVDMGgoA2uzWyWL","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/repair.cpp:23://   4. proposer: `claude -p` bounded by a wall clock, cwd = the WORK COPY,\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/repair.cpp:957:  // not a counter. It is an ESTIMATE and it says so: `claude -p --output-format\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/trace.cpp:529:  // priced a token. The header hard-codes \"· claude -p\" and prints \"? · 0 tok ·\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/trace.cpp:567:    snprintf(h,sizeof h,\"%srabadon trace%s  %s%.8s%s · %s · %s · %s · %s · %s · claude -p\\n\",\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/trace.cpp:579:    if(n.tokens>0){ char m[128]; snprintf(m,sizeof m,\"claude -p  %s  %s  %s\",(commafy(n.tokens)+\" tok\").c_str(),fmt_usd(n.usd_e6).c_str(),fmt_ms(n.dur_ms).c_str()); metrics=m; }\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/pipeline.cpp:36://   proposer  = env RABADON_PROPOSER (default: claude -p …), prompt on stdin,\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/pipeline.cpp:175:  string proposer=prop?prop:\"claude -p --output-format text --permission-mode acceptEdits --allowedTools Read,Edit,Write,Bash,Grep,Glob\";\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/do.cpp:4://   PLAN   one claude -p call decomposes the task into a pipeline whose every\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/do.cpp:34:// feed prompt to `claude -p` on stdin, return its stdout\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/do.cpp:37:  string cmd=\"cd \\\"\"+dir+\"\\\" && claude -p --output-format text < \\\"\"+tmp+\"\\\" 2>/dev/null\";\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/cmdtext.h:41://   claude -p \"run this: git push --force origin master\"\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:270:// fork/exec `claude -p --output-format text [--model M]`, write the prompt to\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:1773:// bounded `claude -p`, 90s / 4MB. Returns a parsed verdict or {ok=false}.\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:1812:// bounded `claude -p --model $RABADON_JUDGE_MODEL`, 30s / 1MB. Fail-open.\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:2648:  //         `claude -p` inherits — without it the supervisor supervises itself)\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:2732:  // re-anchor — the LLM stays off the hot path (bounded `claude -p`).\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:3498:        // USD: `claude -p --output-format text` prints no usage, so the tokens\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/native/gate.cpp:3872:    // diagnose/judge children run `claude -p` from inside a hook) must\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/bin/rabadon.mjs:254:  // a headless Claude session inside the project, which means the project's\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/bin/rabadon.mjs:297:      cp.execSync('claude -p --permission-mode acceptEdits --allowedTools \"Read,Edit,Write,Bash,Grep,Glob\"', {\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/hooks/install.mjs:161://   PostToolUse  no suite, but the incident brain is a bounded `claude -p`\n/Users/damummyphus/damla_projects_2026/rabadon-kosu2/repair/claude-code.mjs:7:// `claude -p` runs headless, takes a prompt on stdin, prints the answer.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0192cvfjsyyZKrJXRYLswB6P","session_id":"81910dae-7509-4342-9a27-c75d4f682cbf","uuid":"81f7e36b-8420-456f-80ea-42a2bb52048e","timestamp":"2026-08-24T13:51:19.335Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Trace counter in observe mode"}
