{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeMiJBYENBSW9jTHMbw5p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Confirmed harness bug, and it invalidates every B row.** `rabadon: attempt` appears **0 times** in the B transcript — my `>/dev/null 2>&1` silenced the hook's stdout, which is exactly the channel Claude Code hooks use to talk to the agent. B1.5's recipe only redirects *stdin*; I added the stdout redirect myself.\n\nSo \"arm B\" as run was: rabadon writes a ledger and says nothing to the agent. That's a null treatment — 7a cannot mean anything. Stopping."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2130,"cache_read_input_tokens":183800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2130},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81910dae-7509-4342-9a27-c75d4f682cbf","uuid":"e2b1d0b4-77d3-420b-83dc-1d7001df2e54","request_id":"req_011CeMiJ7Vu1Xd8hiwheuk2V"}
