{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lr8w7X4iF1V6qpVh7Yx5rp","type":"tool_result","content":"ok    the real ~/.claude is never named: nothing in this suite reads it\nok    corpus walk: TOTAL 1268832 tokens == canonical sum over all 9 transcripts\nok    corpus walk: all 3 project dirs represented in the rows\nok    corpus walk: silent stderr over a truncated transcript and a blank line\n\nlens_test: 14 ok, 0 bad\n./native/regression_demo.sh\n  baseline (correct code):\n  ok   - shallow gate passes on good code\n  ok   - behavior gate passes on good code\n  after a behavior-breaking edit:\n  ok   - shallow gate MISSES the regression (waves the broken edit through)\n  ok   - rabadon behavior gate CATCHES the regression via the project's own tests\n\n  what rabadon reports (the failing test is named):\n    FAIL testsuite [node --test]: the project's own suite is RED (exit 1)\n\nregression: 4 passed, 0 failed\n./native/precision_test.sh\n== rabadon gate precision ==\ncases: 34   correct block: 11   wrong block: 0   missed: 0   correct allow: 23\n\nwrong blocks (work this gate would have cut):\n\nmissed (harm this gate would have let through):\n\nprecision 100.0%  (a refusal is the right refusal this often)\nrecall    100.0%  (real harm the gate actually stops)\nfloor     90%\n\nrule families (each negative needs a live positive above it):\n  ok   baseline-force-push: 1 must-block (1 still blocking), 0 must-not-block\n  ok   baseline-rm-rf-outside: 1 must-block (1 still blocking), 2 must-not-block\n  ok   no-force-push-main: 3 must-block (3 still blocking), 10 must-not-block\n  ok   no-hard-reset-main: 1 must-block (1 still blocking), 1 must-not-block\n  ok   no-rm-rf-outside: 1 must-block (1 still blocking), 0 must-not-block","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81910dae-7509-4342-9a27-c75d4f682cbf","uuid":"968a10fc-b8dd-43bc-a02b-c8a099c9cbe7","timestamp":"2026-08-24T14:49:11.030Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":